<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed values steady, meal mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed values steady, meal mixed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed and meal values were unchanged. Moderate sales of gluten meal to poultry producers was reported kept some prices steady, while prices at other markets eased, dealers said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	    unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   79.00     79.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  350.00    355.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   72.00     72.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  350.00    350.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
